.TH "PB-INBOX-REQUESTS" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-inbox-requests - List team file requests


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb inbox requests [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List team file requests

.PP
List pending team file requests and their identities for review. Use approve or decline with the exact request ID and current generation.

.PP
The Paperboat Inbox receives verified files and exact team requests. Files remain until removed by the user. The receiving path is a local machine setting; team request acceptance is an account policy. A sender manages outgoing batches with pb send.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for requests

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-inbox(1)\fP
